    "text": "<p>Figures (a), (b), (c) and (d) show variation of force with time.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0024_e76924145c9d.png\" style=\"width: 362px; height: 250px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0024_1e14db9d0eca.png\" style=\"width: 364px; height: 250px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0024_e0a266c0b10e.png\" style=\"width: 354px; height: 245px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0024_18218a2092ea.png\" style=\"width: 358px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>The impulse is highest in figure.</p>"
